 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "Scenario",
   "items": [
    "OAUTH_ENABLED=true, TRANSPORT=streamable-http, OAUTH_STORE=redis",
    "On stdio, OAuth plays no part: nothing checks a Bearer",
    "Continued in part 2: code exchange, Bearer call, refresh"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Registration TTL",
   "items": [
    "Client with secret: lives until secret expiry (30 days), known to it",
    "Public client: 30 days from registration; each code exchange or refresh on /token (part 2) extends it, to no less than 31 days",
    "Empty OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET_EXPIRY_SECONDS: no expiry"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "One-shot records",
   "items": [
    "state (600 s) and mcp_ code (300 s) are claimed once",
    "In Redis, the request whose DEL removed the record gets it",
    "Yandex code never goes to the client: it's in the mcp_ record"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Errors",
   "items": [
    "Unknown or expired client_id at /authorize → 400",
    "Foreign or stale state at /callback → 400 invalid state",
    "User declines at Yandex → 400, the client keeps waiting"
   ]
  }
 ]
